  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/cobweb/banner.png\" alt=\"Cobweb 横幅\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=26.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-5.svg\" alt=\"1.21.5\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-4.svg\" alt=\"1.21.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-3.svg\" alt=\"1.21.3\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"加载器\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"分隔线\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client-server.svg\" alt=\"客户端/服务端\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"问题反馈\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>Cobweb</strong> 是一款轻量级、模块化的 API，旨在简化跨多个加载器的 Minecraft 模组开发。<br>\n它提供了<strong>统一配置系统</strong>和<strong>统一注册系统</strong>，均可直接在公共模块中使用。这些系统可帮助您屏蔽不同加载器之间的差异，让您专注于编写简洁、可维护且可复用的代码——而非繁琐的样板代码。</p>\n<p>Cobweb 是 <strong>Crystal Nest</strong> 旗下所有项目共用的模组开发 API。<br>\n📚 想深入了解？请查阅完整的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/cobweb/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fcobweb%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/cobweb/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p>\n<h2>✨ <strong>特性</strong></h2>\n<p>无论您是为 Fabric 还是 NeoForge 开发模组，Cobweb 都能帮助统一您的开发工作流。您可以将其作为多加载器项目的基础，或作为依赖项来简化架构！</p>\n<h3>🔄 通用功能（适用于所有加载器）：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ 统一配置系统 —— 一次编写配置，处处加载</li>\n<li>✅ 统一注册系统 —— 抽象化加载器特定的注册逻辑</li>\n<li>🔍 获取游戏内 ID 的简易 API</li>\n<li>📦 创建并注册<strong>动态</strong>资源包 <em>（实验性）</em></li>\n<li>📦 创建并注册<strong>内置</strong>（静态）资源包</li>\n<li>🌀 用于可变方块集合的动态区块实体</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>仅 Fabric 功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>📝 简化的注册系统。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>仅 NeoForge 功能：</h3>\n<p>目前暂无。</p>\n<h2>📜 <strong>许可证与使用权限</strong></h2>\n<p>欢迎在您的模组、整合包或视频中自由使用本模组，请务必注明出处并附上 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a> 链接。<br>\n本项目基于 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/cobweb/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest 社区许可证 v1</a> 发布。</p>\n<h2>❤️ <strong>支持我们</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest 官网\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"我们的其他项目\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p></p>",
